  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Hide In Plain Sight**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Know Til Now**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Actress**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **True Nature**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **The World's Smiling Now**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **In the Moment**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Dear One**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **I'm Set Free**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2016-11-27** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 112 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Jim James handled vocals plus both acoustic and electric guitar for this performance [1]\n- Seth Kauffman played bass and sang backing vocals; Lacey Guthrie played accordion and keys and also sang backing vocals [1]\n- Maryliz Bender was on drums and percussion, and also added backing vocals [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2016-11-27**: taped by bersey; transferred by Kurt Berwanger; source: CA-11 cardioids > CA-9100 > Sony PCM-M10 @ 24 bit/48kHz [1]",
